oPlayer/issues/7508","id":648991793,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY0ODk5MTc5Mw==","user":{"login":"victorraft","id":4753889,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTM4ODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4753889?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft","html_url":"https://github.com/victorraft","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-06-24T18:30:25Z","updated_at":"2020-06-24T18:48:12Z","body":"I updated to 2.11.6 but I cannot compile my app because this method in ImaAdsLoader don't exist anymore: `public void addCallback(VideoAdPlayerCallback videoAdPlayerCallback)`.\r\n\r\nI scanned through the source code but I'm failing to see where I'm supposed to register my VideoAdPlayerCallback. I specifically use the onPlay and onError callbacks.\r\nCan you point me to what should I do to receive these callbacks? \r\nDo you think it should be fine if I replaced these callbacks with the usage of AdEvent.AdEventListener's `onAdEvent(AdEvent)` checking if the AdEvent's `type` is CONTENT_PAUSE_REQUESTED or AD_BREAK_FETCH_ERROR (for replacing VideoAdPlayerCallback's `onPlay` and `onError`, respectively)?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/648991793/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"victorraft","id":4753889,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTM4ODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4753889?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft","html_url":"https://github.com/victorraft","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorraft/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/649037423","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7508#issuecomment-649037423","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7508","id":649037423,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY0OTAzNzQyMw==","user":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-06-24T19:56:29Z","updated_at":"2020-06-24T19:56:29Z","body":"I moved those into an inner class which isn't visible (it wasn't really intentional to expose `VideoAdPlayer` in the first place, but this move was specifically to avoid the `release` method clashing).\r\n\r\nUsing `AdEventListener` may work too for `CONTENT_PAUSE_REQUESTED` (although I don't think you'll see that multiple times for ads in a pod), but `AD_BREAK_FETCH_ERROR` only notifies empty ad tags rather than actual ad playback errors.\r\n\r\nAre you able to use the player event listener to detect the cases you need? There is some sample code to know what ad is playing based on position discontinuities in #6249. For the error case you can look for errors reported via `onPlayerError` (and, if needed, ad prepare errors reported via load errors with `C.DATA_TYPE_AD`).","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/649037423/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https:/